  "body": "## What changed\n- Updated `emitArcWithRadius` in `assets/posts/fanuc.cps`, `assets/posts/haas.cps`, `assets/posts/mazak.cps`, `assets/posts/doosan-dnm.cps`, `assets/posts/tormach.cps`, and `assets/posts/grblhal.cps`.\n- The helper computes both endpoint radii `r0` and `r1`, uses the mean `r = (r0 + r1) * 0.5`, and falls back to I/J/K when `Math.abs(r0 - r1) > Math.min(0.02, Math.max(0.002, r * 0.005))`.\n- The helper splits full and near-360 degree arcs (`full || sweep >= 2 * Math.PI - Math.PI / 9`) into 4 quadrant segments, splits near-180 degree arcs (`Math.abs(sweep - Math.PI) <= Math.PI / 9`) into 2 ~90 degree segments, and interpolates axis `h` linearly per segment.\n- `buildSegs` checks every segment after output rounding (`fu(...)` relative to `[orgX, orgY, orgZ]`): `rp > 0`, `chord > 0`, `chord <= 2 * rp - 1e-7`, and `chord <= 2 * rp * 0.99` when unsplit (`count === 1`, re-splitting into quadrants if triggered).\n- When any guard fails, `emitArcWithRadius` returns `false` before calling `block(...)`, so `onCircular` falls back cleanly to I/J/K without partial output or stale plane state.\n- Added `crates/post/tests/radius_arcs.rs` to pin all six posts and recorded the trade-offs in `docs/decisions/2191-radius-arcs-180.md`.\n\n## Cause\n- `emitArcWithRadius` computed `R` only from `from -> center` and split only exact full circles (`< 1e-5`).\n- Helix half-turns from the 1 micron lattice carry slight endpoint radius differences and 180 degree sweeps, so separate rounding of `X`/`Y`/`Z` (`wo(...)`) and `R` (`w(\"R\", ...)`) wrote `R1.235`/`R1.234` and chords longer than `2|R|` (`2.469 > 2.468`), while magnifying center drift near 180 degrees.\n\n## Tests\n- Pins in `crates/post/tests/radius_arcs.rs` (across `fanuc`, `haas`, `mazak`, `doosan-dnm`, `tormach`, `grblhal`):\n  - `helix_half_turns_use_reachable_r_and_stay_on_circle` (red before fix, green after)\n  - `near_180_and_full_circle_arcs_in_all_planes_hold_chord_and_center` (red before fix, green after)\n  - `inch_and_nonzero_origin_arcs_hold_after_rounding` (red before fix, green after)\n  - `major_arcs_use_negative_r_and_degenerate_arcs_fall_back_to_ijk` (red before fix, green after)\n  - `recorded_arc_streams_post_valid_r_arcs`\n- Mutation checks on `assets/posts/fanuc.cps` (each guard reverted -> red, restored -> green):\n  - Removing the radius-mismatch guard failed `major_arcs_use_negative_r_and_degenerate_arcs_fall_back_to_ijk` (`fanuc/mismatch`); restoring passed all 5 tests.\n  - Disabling the near-180 / near-360 split and `0.99` chord guard (keeping the old 2-way full-circle split) failed 4 tests; restoring passed all 5 tests.\n  - Removing the post-rounding `rp > 0` and `chord <= 2 * rp` checks failed `major_arcs_use_negative_r_and_degenerate_arcs_fall_back_to_ijk` (`fanuc/tiny_inch`); restoring passed all 5 tests.\n- Checks after final edit:\n  - `cargo test -p camcraft-post --test radius_arcs`: 5 passed, 0 failed.\n  - `cargo clippy -p camcraft-post --all-targets -- -D warnings`: green (0 warnings).\n  - `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`: green (0 warnings).\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`:\n  - `[01] post suites` (42 suites): passed in 23s.\n  - `[02] app suites` (68 suites): 67 suites passed. `first_4axis_part::the_committed_project_posts_the_committed_program` failed at `machine::check_document` (`\"Flat A-90: inputs moved since generation - regenerate before posting\"`). The other 3 tests in `first_4axis_part` passed. That single failure is pre-existing on `upstream/main` (`e3ca44fa7`) because `examples/first-4axis-part.camproj` still carries v2 stamps under `camcraft-op-stamp-v3` (#2198, open PR #2200).\n\n## Goldens moved\nNone (`git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty).\n\n## Not exercised\n- Full `batch` and `release` gate tiers, UI suites (no UI files changed), and re-running `app suites` on top of PR #2200 (`examples/first-4axis-part.camproj` stamp v3 regeneration).\n\n## Overlaps\nTouches the same `.cps` files in different functions (whichever merges second refreshes):\n- `#2162` (`assets/posts/doosan-dnm.cps`: `reversedLoneXRotary`)\n- `#2136` (`assets/posts/fanuc.cps`, `assets/posts/haas.cps`, `assets/posts/mazak.cps`, `assets/posts/doosan-dnm.cps`: `onParameter`, `startPreamble`, `endPreamble`)\n- `#2048` and `#1821` (`assets/posts/fanuc.cps`, `assets/posts/haas.cps`, `assets/posts/mazak.cps`, `assets/posts/doosan-dnm.cps`: `onCycle`)\n- `#1738` lists the post files in GitHub's diff from its older base PR `#1717` and changes no posted G-code.\nNo open PR changes `emitArcWithRadius` or `onCircular`.\n\nChangelog: Split near-180° and near-360° useRadiusArcs arcs into quadrant segments and check chord <= 2|R| after rounding.\nEffort: high\nFixes #2191\n",
